  "goodToKnow": "Die Modernisierung is modernisation: die Modernisierung der Verwaltung, die Modernisierung der Bundeswehr. In German tenancy law, a landlord can pass part of the cost of a Modernisierung on to tenants as a rent increase (Modernisierungsumlage), a hot topic in cities. Germans often speak of a Modernisierungsstau (backlog), especially in digitalisation and railways. From modernisieren, to modernise."
